{"t":"Bewitched","s":"bewitched-85671","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Marsh_Stalker_Beak_989259.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Bewitched</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Witches' Cauldron Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"time\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Time</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">June 21st–25th (+10 days of rewards)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(8 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">World Quest</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.70<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 8, 2010<br/>Winter Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>To avert the wrath of evil spirits, all Tibians will have to help the good witches to create a powerful spirit brew. Gather exotic ingredients and protect the witches' cauldron from the forces of destruction.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Green Claw Swamp</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snakes</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworms</a> on the way to the quest area and <a href=\"#/wiki/Bane%20Bringer\">Bane Bringers</a> as well as the <a href=\"#/wiki/Bane%20Lord\">Bane Lord</a> during the event.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>Points that can be exchanged with <a href=\"#/wiki/Minzy\">Minzy</a> for Potions and <a href=\"#/wiki/Raven%20Kit\">Raven</a> decorations, up to 8 Achievements (22 points) and 50% experience bonus for 10 days.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-quest-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>This world quest originally took place between the server saves of January 12 and January 16 until 2018. This changed with the introduction of the <a href=\"#/quest/winterlight-solstice\">Winterlight Solstice</a> in Update 12.02. Additionally, in 2019, <a href=\"#/wiki/Chicken%20Feather\">Chicken Feathers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord%20Eye\">Bonelord Eyes</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Dust\">Vampire Dust</a> were replaced with <a href=\"#/wiki/Marsh%20Stalker%20Beak\">Marsh Stalker Beaks</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Flask%20of%20Eyedrops\">Small Flasks of Eyedrops</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Lancet\">Lancets</a>. The experience bonus was also increased from <b>20%</b> to <b>50%</b>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h3>\n<p>The required equipment may vary depending on the way you use to reach the quest area. If you follow the method shown in this page, you will only need a machete.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\">Machete</a> or equivalent.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a> or equivalent.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a> or equivalent.</li></ul>\n<p>The cauldron needs approximately 200 of any of the following items at one time (not per person), you may add as many as you can until the pot is full.<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Marsh%20Stalker%20Beak\"><img alt=\"Marsh Stalker Beak\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Marsh_Stalker_Beak_989259.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Marsh%20Stalker%20Beak\">Marsh Stalker Beak</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bat%20Wing\"><img alt=\"Bat Wing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bat_Wing_49a34e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Bat%20Wing\">Bat Wing</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Flask%20of%20Eyedrops\"><img alt=\"Small Flask of Eyedrops\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Small_Flask_of_Eyedrops_c1cae8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Flask%20of%20Eyedrops\">Small Flask of Eyedrops</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lancet\"><img alt=\"Lancet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lancet_ede1cb.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Lancet\">Lancet</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Spider%20Fangs\"><img alt=\"Spider Fangs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spider_Fangs_0bad45.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Spider%20Fangs\">Spider Fangs</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion%20Tail\"><img alt=\"Scorpion Tail\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scorpion_Tail_a489ba.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion%20Tail\">Scorpion Tail</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Dirt\"><img alt=\"Lump of Dirt\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lump_of_Dirt_a5edfa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Dirt\">Lump of Dirt</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tarantula%20Egg\"><img alt=\"Tarantula Egg\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tarantula_Egg_6c32cf.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Tarantula%20Egg\">Tarantula Egg</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Centipede%20Leg\"><img alt=\"Centipede Leg\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Centipede_Leg_98b019.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Centipede%20Leg\">Centipede Leg</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sulphurous%20Stone\"><img alt=\"Sulphurous Stone\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sulphurous_Stone_00f7e7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Sulphurous%20Stone\">Sulphurous Stone</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Horn\"><img alt=\"Minotaur Horn\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minotaur_Horn_980859.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Horn\">Minotaur Horn</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin%20Ear\"><img alt=\"Goblin Ear\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goblin_Ear_849283.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin%20Ear\">Goblin Ear</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<p>The event happens near <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a> under the <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Green Claw Swamp</a>. The quest area can be reached by many ways, one of the entrances is located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32699,32009,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here. (32699, 32009, 7)</a><br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Witch's Cauldron Quest3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"216\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Witch_s_Cauldron_Quest3_9bb59b.png\" width=\"382\"/></span>\n</p><p>You must go down several levels in order to get to the quest area (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32734,31940,12\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32734, 31940, 12)</a>).<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Witch's Cauldron Quest1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"448\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Witch_s_Cauldron_Quest1_1569b2.png\" width=\"642\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Phases\">Phases</span></h3>\n<p>A new phase begins every 8 hours starting after June 21 <a href=\"#/wiki/Server%20Save\">Server Save</a>.\nWhen the event starts, the message <br/>\n<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">The witches of the green claw swamp need your help to protect the world from the bane-bringers.</span><br/> \ncan be seen upon login. every phase a server message will be shown:<br/>\n<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">The swamp witches need new reagents for their brew!</span><br/>\nIt's possible to check the time left until the next phase by looking on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Witch%27s%20Clock\">Witch's Clocks</a> around the cauldron.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Ingredients\">Ingredients</span></h3>\n<p>Ingredients are shown in a room before you get to the cauldron's area. The ingredients you need are chosen randomly (except for the first, which is always <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Dirt\">Lump of Dirt</a> on all servers) and can be repeated. The cauldron needs 200 of the needed item every phase.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Wood\">Wood</span></h3>\n<p>You can also use <a href=\"#/wiki/Dry%20Piece%20of%20Wood\">dry pieces of wood</a> to receive extra favour points. Note that these pieces must be used on the <b>slide</b> of the cauldron. Also, dry pieces of wood do not have any consequences for the quest or its success. <b>This means your world won't lose the event if nobody adds wood to the slide</b>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Bane_Bringer_Raids\">Bane Bringer Raids</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Dry%20Piece%20of%20Wood\">Dry Pieces of Wood</a> can be looted from <a href=\"#/wiki/Bane%20Bringer\">Bane Bringers</a> which spawn in raids in the area below the cauldron as well as in the beginning of every phase, except for the first (20-35 spawns every raid). \n</p><p>Starting at <a href=\"#/wiki/Server%20Save\">Server Boot</a>, there's a chance of a raid happening exactly every 25 minutes. In order to get this exact time, you must first witness a raid, and then the 25 minutes intervals can be calculated from that. For example, if there was a raid at <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">12:03:55</span>, the next chance of a raid will be at <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">12:28:55</span>. It doesn't matter if a raid happens or not, this 25 minute intervals will still be respected, so there would be another chance of raids at <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">12:53:55</span>. The exact time of the raid varies from server to server due to how long it takes for it to start at <a href=\"#/wiki/Server%20Save\">Server Save</a>. The 25 minute interval will carry over into the next day. For example, if there was a raid just before Server Save at <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">09:48:22</span>, then the next chance of a raid after Server Save will be <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">10:13:22</span>, regardless of when the Server Boot happened.\n</p><p>Bane Bringers can be killed effectively using <a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\">physical</a> attacks. If they are not killed, however, they will disappear after 10 minutes. There is also a chance for the <a href=\"#/wiki/Bane%20Lord\">Bane Lord</a> boss to spawn during the non-ingredient raids, a boss which carries up to 3 dry pieces of wood as well as some <a href=\"#/wiki/Taming%20Items\">Taming Items</a>.\n</p><p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Bewitched/Statistics </i> </span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Favour_Points\">Favour Points</span></h3>\n<p>After adding ingredients to the cauldron, you can talk to <a href=\"#/wiki/Minzy\">Minzy</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32741,31971,12\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32741, 31971, 12)</a>) to trade your earned favour points. These points can be exchanged for <a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potions\">Health</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potions\">Mana</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Spirit%20Potion\">Spirit</a> potions, or for a <a href=\"#/wiki/Raven%20Kit\">Raven</a>. The number of favour points you receive depends on both the type and quantity of ingredients you add to the cauldron. Unspent favour points will carry over to the following year’s event. For more information, you can ask <a href=\"#/wiki/Minzy\">Minzy</a> about her <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Job</span>, <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Ingredients</span>, <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Favour</span>, or <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Trade</span>.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Ingredients_Table\">Ingredients Table</span></h4>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Favour Points\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dry%20Piece%20of%20Wood\"><img alt=\"Dry Piece of Wood\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dry_Piece_of_Wood_567a3f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Dry%20Piece%20of%20Wood\">Dry Piece of Wood</a></td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin%20Ear\"><img alt=\"Goblin Ear\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goblin_Ear_849283.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin%20Ear\">Goblin Ear</a></td>\n<td>5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Dirt\"><img alt=\"Lump of Dirt\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lump_of_Dirt_a5edfa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Dirt\">Lump of Dirt</a></td>\n<td>5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Spider%20Fangs\"><img alt=\"Spider Fangs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spider_Fangs_0bad45.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Spider%20Fangs\">Spider Fangs</a></td>\n<td>5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw: